WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.600
Tags label text, and the browser shows its best guess

2
00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:08.180
A tag is a label. &lt;h1&gt; labels the main heading.

3
00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:12.630
&lt;p&gt; opens a paragraph and &lt;/p&gt; closes it.

4
00:00:13.531 --> 00:00:17.056
&lt;strong&gt; marks an important word, inside the paragraph.

5
00:00:17.831 --> 00:00:21.406
The tags say what the text is. The browser picks the look.

6
00:00:22.131 --> 00:00:25.606
Forget a closing tag and there is no error message...

7
00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:33.775
...the bold just carries on. Check the page after every change.
